      ],
      "source": "https://www.pearldistrictportfolio.com/history",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Artists converted warehouses into studios and galleries, leading to the 1986 historic designation of 13th Avenue.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        9
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.pearldistrictportfolio.com/history",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Maddox Building once stored barrels and crates before becoming a storage facility and later a creative space.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
